          <h3>From 100K to 1M+ markers</h3>
          <dl><div><dt>Problem</dt><dd>Government dashboards needed huge point datasets on a live map. Past ~100K markers, the map stuttered and froze.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>What I did</dt><dd>Moved marker rendering to the GPU: one instanced draw call with custom shaders, instead of one object per marker.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Result</dt><dd class="res">More than 100x faster. Over a million markers pan and zoom smoothly.</dd></div></dl>
